# Get started

Install the Civica layers your interface needs and keep their versions together. Civica has three layers. Read [about the project](about.html) for the household needs behind the design.

| Layer | What it provides | What it cannot do alone |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Theme YAML | Shared colour, type, spacing and component variables across Home Assistant | Rewrite native page content or reach every private component style |
| Optional Civica interface module | Theme colour settings, controlled component styling and Civica browser identity while this theme is active | Change authentication pages, native app splash screens or every third-party card |
| Dashboard components and examples | Reusable arrangements for devices, room navigation and status | Replace Home Assistant's data model or backend permissions |


